      "en": "We took their land, and gave it for an inheritance to the Reubenites, and to the Gadites, and to the half-tribe of the Manassites.",
      "ko": "그 땅을 취하여 르우벤과 갓과 므낫세 반 지파에게 기업으로 주었나니",
      "source_text_hash": "84983d811212f346e9634633ba86857a221af93889651393c44d184ccabd0b6d",
      "translation_text_hash": "1eb3cda94447bb45b3c5c5ec5e03b8601a6c60915c4d13a8eb4c56a1b8323c43",
